# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Design reference
#
# assets/old/ holds the source art the shipped images were derived from.
# The full-page reference screenshot alone is ~17MB, which is more than
# the entire rest of the project — keep it locally, out of git history.
# To drop the whole reference folder instead, uncomment the second line.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
assets/old/screencapture-*.png
# assets/old/
